: `agent-report`, `agent-ready`, `ohc:lane:<lane>`, `ohc:journey:J1` for the service loop. Lanes: `revenue`, `agents`, `activation`, `finance`, `growth`, `integrations`, `ux`, `ui`, `reliability`, `performance`, `security`, `governance`, `documentation`, `maintenance`, `release`. Add ready only for a bounded implementable issue; unresolved research/dependencies remain draft.
